{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And you take captives of his captives.</b> Rashi explained: to include Canaanites [listed] in the Torah, even though they are among the seven nations. And the world raises a difficulty: how is it derived from ושבית שביו? And one may answer that this is what it says: ושבית שביו — of your enemies, i.e., even the Canaanites whom your enemies captured — and you take them."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:01:11.243413588Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}